(a) single-region text popup on TAP from the SQLite OCR cache (`OcrPageResult`), gated by `dictionaryPreferences.ocrResultPresentation == POPUP` and `ocrPrefs.ocrPageTextOverlay()`;
(b) `PanelDebugOverlayView` (P/B labelled coloured boxes), DEBUG builds only, pager only, panel navigation only;
(c) `OcrBubbleVoiceOverlay` single 🔊 badge, pref-gated;
(d) `AutoReadHighlight` — draws nothing (no-op).

